#: ../../source/docs/AP_Periph-Parameters.rst:1727
#: e02d14ca676b45608f5798682c21584a
msgid "This controls the time constant for the cross\\-over frequency used to fuse AHRS \\(airspeed and heading\\) and GPS data to estimate ground velocity\\. Time constant is 0\\.1\\/beta\\. A larger time constant will use GPS data less and a small time constant will use air data less\\."
msgstr ""

