msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/AP_Periph-Parameters.rst:1746
#: 950079ff1cc04208973b330a3aaebd21
msgid "Minimum number of satellites visible to use GPS for velocity based corrections attitude correction\\. This defaults to 6\\, which is about the point at which the velocity numbers from a GPS become too unreliable for accurate correction of the accelerometers\\."
msgstr ""

