msgid "This is the ratio of static pressure error to dynamic pressure generated by a negative wind relative velocity along the Y body axis\\. If the baro height estimate rises during sideways flight to the left\\, then this should be a negative number\\. Multirotors can use this feature only if using EKF3 and if the EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_X and EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_Y parameters have been tuned\\."
