#: 36d149e0cd7e4cde8663e1fef956c0a8
#: 4962478191ca42569bf494319b51d9b4
msgid "Harmonic Notch Filter dynamic frequency tracking mode\\. Dynamic updates can be throttle\\, RPM sensor\\, ESC telemetry or dynamic FFT based\\. Throttle\\-based harmonic notch cannot be used on fixed wing only planes\\. It can for Copters\\, QuaadPlane\\(while in VTOL modes\\)\\, and Rovers\\."
msgstr ""

